  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Accelerating Control of the HIV Epidemic in Nigeria (ACE)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The primary focus of the activity is to support relevant HIV/AIDS/TB service delivery, through a combination of direct service delivery support and technical assistance in Nigeria, across a variety of technical areas relevant to the continuum of prevention, care, and treatment of HIV infection.</narrative>
  </description>
